  "description": "The Windows platform shell for the Photon engine: a real Win32 window (per-monitor DPI, dark-mode follow, unified chrome) presenting through Vulkan where an ICD exists and through the Reference backend where none does, with DirectWrite text, Direct2D icons and WIC images — system APIs only, through slim typed bindings (no COM interop framework, no third-party package).",
